From: Mellanox Platform Team <root@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH platform 1/1] platform: mellanox: mlx-platform: Extend Kconfig help text.

---
 drivers/platform/mellanox/Kconfig | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/platform/mellanox/Kconfig b/drivers/platform/mellanox/Kconfig
index 6b83a9b45..9c1d2e7f8 100644
--- a/drivers/platform/mellanox/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/platform/mellanox/Kconfig
@@ -34,6 +34,9 @@ config MLX_PLATFORM
 	  This driver provides support for the Mellanox systems platform
 	  features, such as hotplug events, LED control and thermal
 	  monitoring on Nvidia switch systems.
+
+	  Say Y here if you are building a kernel for an Nvidia switch
+	  system. Otherwise say N.
 
 config MLXBF_TMFIFO
 	tristate "Mellanox BlueField SoC TmFifo platform driver"
